    "scenesThatPass": [
      "PHOENIX: That’s not the question you should be asking. Everybody here is the best there is. Who the hell are they gonna get to teach us?\nPENNY: It’s been declined.",
      "PENNY: Finish up. We need to get the boat to the yard.\nAMELIA: I can’t go.\nPENNY: What do you mean you can’t go?\nAMELIA: Test tomorrow. I have to study. They only told us today.",
      "AMELIA: Mom, is that you?\nPENNY: Yeah. Yeah, it’s me, all right.",
      "AMELIA: Mom, I’m home.\nPENNY: Thought you were staying at Karen’s tonight.\nAMELIA: Karen’s sick and I have homework to do.",
      "PENNY: Yeah.\nPENNY: Did you have dinner?\nAMELIA: Not yet. Wanna go out?\nPENNY: No, no. I’ll make you something."
    ]
